{
  "name": "@ycet/dsh-session-plus",
  "version": "0.9.0",
  "description": "会话增强插件：模型选择菜单顶部实时展示当前模型提供商名称；账户菜单顶部提供「跟随系统 / 浅色 / 深色」主题快捷切换（Rubber Segment 动效，v0.9.0 起用具官方太阳 / 月亮 / 显示器图标）；官方模型菜单「推理等级」一行改造为 Codex 风格连续滑条（一档一色 + 最高档能量层）；新建会话页标题栏补上官方「在应用中打开」分体按钮；侧栏账户行右侧常驻设置齿轮（一键直达通用设置）；账户菜单新增语言切换（读取官方 locale 快照的 8 种语言）；助手回复里的 mermaid 代码块自动渲染为 SVG（懒加载 mermaid 11.17.2，源码 / 复制 / 下载工具条，跟随主题）；「设置 → 通用」里为以上七项各提供一个独立开关（复用官方 Switch 组件）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs",
    "build:mermaid": "node scripts/build-mermaid-chunk.mjs"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.2.1-rc.2"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-model-selection"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README_en.md",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "NOTICE.md",
    "scripts"
  ],
  "author": "Ycet",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Ycet/dsh-session-plus.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Ycet/dsh-session-plus#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Ycet/dsh-session-plus/issues"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public",
    "registry": "https://registry.npmjs.org/"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
